    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akusitumisya kumusi ngosyo sya kungopoko lyuŵa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵaŵilasile pamo ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa upande wa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵatite kwa jemanjajo, “Jemanja atesile yosope yene yiŵalamwile Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti ayitende, nipo apikanile malamusi gangu gosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.20+NUM.32.21+NUM.32.22+NUM.32.23+NUM.32.24+NUM.32.25+NUM.32.26+NUM.32.27+NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 32:20-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1:12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jele ndaŵi josopeji nginimwatila ni kamo kose Aisalaeli acimjenu. Mŵele ŵakusamalicisya pakupikanila Malamusi ga AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mpela muŵaŵecetele, AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu ŵapele mtendele Aisalaeli acimjenu. Myoyo ajawuleje, kuwujila kumusi ku cilambo ciŵasumwile ni kuŵa cawo, cilambo ca ku mbali ja kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani, ciŵapele Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlolecesye kuti mkugapikanila malamusi giŵamlamwile Mose gakuti: mwanonyeleje AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, kutenda lisosa lyakwe, kupikanila malamusi gakwe, mŵe ŵakulupicika kwa Mlungu jwenu, ni kumtumicila ni mtima wenu wosope ni umi wenu wosope.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵatumisye jemanjajo kumusi, mkanatyoce jwalakwe ŵaŵecete maloŵe aga: “AMBUJE apitilisye kwapa upile jemanja. Jemanja mkwawula kumusi mli ŵakusicila kwejinji, pamo ni yilangwa yejinji, silifa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " golidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bulonsi, ayiloni, ni nguwo syejinji. Mkagaŵane ni acalongo acimjenu yimjigele kutyocela kwa amagongo ŵenu.” Nipo jemanjajo ŵatyosile kwawula kumusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ŵapelece cilambo ca kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Yolodani kwa hafu ja lukosyo lwa Manase, nambo kwa litika linelyo Yoswa ŵapelece cilambo ca kungapilo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani, pamo ni mitundu jine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Manase ŵawujile kumusi. Ŵalesile Aisalaeli ŵakusigala ku Shilo mcilambo ca Kenani, cilambo cawo ca Giliyadi, cili kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Lusulo lwa Yolodani. Mose ŵaliji ali ŵasalile kalakala kuti, “Aci ni cilambo cakusosa AMBUJE kuti acijigale ciŵe cawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malo gakupelecela mbopesi ciŵandika ni Lusulo lwa Yolodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitundu ja Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Manase pijayice ku Geliloti, mbali jijojo ja kungapilo lyuŵa kwa Yolodani, ŵataŵile kweleko malo ga mbopesi gamakulungwa ni gakutesya lung'wanu ciŵandika ni Lusulo lwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵane wosope ŵapikene kuti ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Manase ŵataŵile malo ga mbopesi ku Gililoti, ku mbali jawo ja Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli piŵapikene yeleyi, likuga lyosope lyayice pamo ku Shilo kuti ajawule akamenyane ni mitundu ja kungopoko lyuŵa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵamtumile Finihasi mwanace jwa Eliyesa jwakutaga mbopesi, kuti ajawule kwa ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa upande wa Manase mcilambo ca Giliyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwakulungwa likumi ŵakutyocela ku ngosyo syosope ŵalongene pamo ni Finihasi ni jwamkulungwa jwa liŵasa lililyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵayice ku cilambo ca Giliyadi, kwa ŵandu ŵa Lubeni, Gadi, ni kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo ŵaŵecete m'malo mwa likuga lyosope lya AMBUJE, ŵatite kwa jemanjajo, “Ligongo cici jemanja atesile aci cindu cakusakala cakusisyana ni Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli? Mwajimucile AMBUJE pakulitaŵila jemanja jika aga malo ga mbopesiga! Jemanja basi ngakwakuya soni AMBUJE!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13+DEU.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 12:13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaliŵalila ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wetu utwalemwecesye AMBUJE ku Piyoli. Pajatu AMBUJE ŵatupele cilango ca mlili wakogoya uwawuleje ŵandu ŵajinji, atamose uwe tuli ŵandu ŵakwe. Sonitu tukulagape ligongo lya ulemwa ula. Ana ulemwa wewula nganiwukwana?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 25:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana jemanja mkukana kwakuya AMBUJE sambano? Naga mkwajimucila AMBUJE lelo, malaŵi AMBUJE tacimtumbilila jwalijose mu Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni naga mcilambo mwawo muli mwangaŵajilwa kupopelelamo, ayice ajinjile mcilambo ca AMBUJE, mujili Tenti jakwe. Aŵende malo gane pasikati petu. Nambo akasiŵajimucila AMBUJE kapena kuti akatutendesya uwe kuŵa ŵakwimucila pakutaŵa malo ga mbopesi konjecesya ku malo ga mbopesi ga AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaliŵalila muŵakanile kupikanila lilamusi Akani mwanace jwa Sela pa yindu yakusakala yiyikaŵajilwe kuyijonanga; likuga lyosope lya Aisalaeli lyapegwile cilango ligongo lya yeleyo. Nganaŵa Akanipe ŵiŵawile ligongo lya ulemwa wawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1+JOS.7.2+JOS.7.3+JOS.7.4+JOS.7.5+JOS.7.6+JOS.7.7+JOS.7.8+JOS.7.9+JOS.7.10+JOS.7.11+JOS.7.12+JOS.7.13+JOS.7.14+JOS.7.15+JOS.7.16+JOS.7.17+JOS.7.18+JOS.7.19+JOS.7.20+JOS.7.21+JOS.7.22+JOS.7.23+JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 7:1-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
